+/* OmacVM: shader constants in uniform buffers. Before a submit is decoded, the payloads
+ * of its SET_CONSTANT_BUFFER commands are copied into one staging block; the first of
+ * them that runs uploads the block with one glBufferData into the next buffer of the
+ * sub context's ring, and every draw then binds its stage's range of it. */
